   "text": "States: empty — \"Nothing is waiting for review\"; loading — skeleton; error — inline \"Reason required\"; \"The common plan moved since sharing — rebase before confirming\"\nwith a button to S-19; engine error \"Nothing confirmed\", Retry; success — toast \"Confirmed · alerts sent\", the tree shows the scenario as Confirmed, the common plan\ncarries per-row provenance.",
   "originalText": "States: empty — \"Nothing is waiting for review\"; loading — skeleton; error — inline \"Reason required\"; \"The common plan moved since sharing — rebase before confirming\"\nwith a button to S-19; engine error \"Nothing confirmed\", Retry; success — toast \"Confirmed · alerts sent\", the tree shows the scenario as Confirmed, the common plan\ncarries per-row provenance.",
